From: illumos-drm <illumos-drm@code.aopc.cloud>
Subject: [PATCH 01] drm_suballoc.h: include <linux/wait.h> for wait_queue_head_t

struct drm_suballoc_manager has a wait_queue_head_t; Linux gets
<linux/wait.h> through <linux/dma-fence.h>, the LinuxKPI layer does not.

diff --git a/include/drm/drm_suballoc.h b/include/drm/drm_suballoc.h
index 29befdda3..0598282c2 100644
--- a/include/drm/drm_suballoc.h
+++ b/include/drm/drm_suballoc.h
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 #include <drm/drm_mm.h>
 
 #include <linux/dma-fence.h>
+#include <linux/wait.h>
 #include <linux/types.h>
 
 #define DRM_SUBALLOC_MAX_QUEUES 32
